<title>UK: Cinven to buy UK defence  unit for 74 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Cinven to buy UK defence  unit for 74 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>British management buyout group Cinven said on Thursday it had exchanged contracts to buy the support services division of the Defence Evaluation and Research Agency (DERA) for 74 million stg.</p>
</text>
